{"id":"2114413884081606862","url":"https://x.com/parametricarch/status/2114413884081606862","author":{"name":"ParametricArchitecture","handle":"parametricarch","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1097430083638345728/S5nwLNO-_200x200.jpg","square":false,"badge":"blue"},"lang":"en","createdAt":"2026-10-25T17:48:48.000Z","rich":["📌 The Mercedes-Benz Museum in Stuttgart transforms more than 140 years of automotive history into an architectural experience shaped by geometry, movement, and spatial continuity.\n\nDesigned by UNStudio and opened in 2006, the building is defined by a complex double-helix"],"media":[{"type":"video","src":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2114413836681830400/img/3M2z54HjFpeeVvpM.jpg","w":720,"h":1280,"mp4":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2114413836681830400/vid/avc1/720x1280/OTBop0rc4HQo-tRS.mp4"}],"replies":0,"likes":42,"more":true,"topics":["arch"],"addedOn":"2026-10-26","following":false,"ko":"📌 슈투트가르트의 메르세데스-벤츠 박물관은 140년이 넘는 자동차 역사를 기하학, 움직임, 끊김 없는 공간으로 빚어낸 건축 경험으로 바꿔 놓았어요.\n\nUNStudio가 설계해 2006년에 문을 열었고, 건물은 복잡한 이중 나선 …"},
{"id":"2114405388171034809","url":"https://x.com/DannyLimanseta/status/2114405388171034809","author":{"name":"Danny Limanseta","handle":"DannyLimanseta","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1653760191542996994/gxsaTn-0_200x200.png","square":false,"badge":"blue"},"lang":"en","createdAt":"2026-10-25T17:15:02.000Z","rich":["Played around with Unreal Engine this weekend. \n\nI always thought Unreal was for the AAA gamedevs but turns out UE is pretty vibe-code friendly once I got the set up done. This prototype is done entirely from Claude Code with CLI, so I didnt have to open up the UE editor at all."],"media":[{"type":"video","src":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2114404239929954304/img/wwAG84OaW1ZNW2Y3.jpg","w":1920,"h":1200,"mp4":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2114404239929954304/vid/avc1/1152x720/LXb336cvyYPFXIWd.mp4"}],"replies":99,"likes":783,"more":true,"topics":["unreal","gamedev"],"addedOn":"2026-10-26","following":false,"ko":"이번 주말에 언리얼 엔진을 만져 봤어요.\n\n언리얼은 AAA 게임 개발자용이라고만 생각했는데, 처음 설정만 끝내니 바이브 코딩하기에 꽤 좋더라고요. 이 프로토타입은 전부 Claude Code의 CLI로 만들어서, UE 에디터는 한 번도 열지 않았어요."},
{"id":"2114400375583424795","url":"https://x.com/chojondocho/status/2114400375583424795","author":{"name":"Chojondocho | AI Agent Lab","handle":"chojondocho","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2048291755485995008/-zt-WjKn_200x200.jpg","square":false,"badge":null},"lang":"en","createdAt":"2026-10-25T16:55:07.000Z","rich":["Fable 5.5 becomes the first model to fully automate at least 10% of Anthropic's model R&D (AL5)."],"media":[{"type":"photo","src":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVfb73jaMAAzeqy.jpg","w":1920,"h":1230}],"replies":0,"likes":1,"topics":["ai"],"addedOn":"2026-10-26","following":false,"ko":"Fable 5.5가 Anthropic 모델 연구개발(AL5)의 최소 10%를 완전히 자동화한 첫 모델이 됐어요."},
{"id":"2114338380376949167","url":"https://x.com/kimmonismus/status/2114338380376949167","author":{"name":"Chubby♨️","handle":"kimmonismus","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1728327996375719936/RW7VBJfD_200x200.jpg","square":false,"badge":"blue"},"lang":"en","createdAt":"2026-10-25T12:48:47.000Z","rich":["This is so much more impressive than seeing a robot doing another MMA stunt. \nETH Zurich taught G1 to climb ladders, climb and much more. \nIt feels like they start to advance at the same pace as LLMs."],"media":[{"type":"video","src":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2113531906973483008/img/H73UyifkQKyhF2vO.jpg","w":1920,"h":1080,"mp4":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2113531906973483008/vid/avc1/1280x720/6JMb5gv6LVoJ5y8i.mp4"}],"replies":122,"likes":1263,"topics":["tech","science"],"addedOn":"2026-10-26","following":true,"ko":"로봇이 또 MMA 묘기를 하는 것보다 훨씬 인상적이에요.\nETH 취리히가 G1에게 사다리 오르기, 기어오르기 등 훨씬 많은 걸 가르쳤어요.\n로봇도 LLM과 같은 속도로 발전하기 시작한 것 같아요."},
{"id":"2114303409449021452","url":"https://x.com/samamiku4/status/2114303409449021452","author":{"name":"samamiku","handle":"samamiku4","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1974553960766930944/AOQ16NPz_200x200.jpg","square":false,"badge":"blue"},"lang":"ja","createdAt":"2026-10-25T10:29:49.000Z","rich":["Opus 5.5 × GodotでフォトリアルなFPSゲームを作れるかテストしました。\n\n廃港を舞台に、敵組織と撃ち合います。\n\nゲームの制作フローと、やってみてわかったことを以下にまとめました。↓\n\n制作フロー\n→ コンセプト画像（GPT）\n→ 廃港ステージや銃の3Dモデル作成（Blender＋Tripo）\n→"],"media":[{"type":"video","src":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2114298039032852480/img/kLc5yWWEbfwRph5E.jpg","w":1920,"h":1080,"mp4":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2114298039032852480/vid/avc1/1280x720/fArt5N597NmMD6Ds.mp4"}],"replies":13,"likes":414,"more":true,"topics":["ai","gamedev"],"addedOn":"2026-10-26","following":false,"ko":"Opus 5.5 × Godot로 실사풍 FPS 게임을 만들 수 있는지 시험해 봤어요.\n\n버려진 항구를 무대로 적 조직과 총격전을 벌여요.\n\n게임 제작 흐름과 해 보며 알게 된 점을 아래에 정리했어요. ↓\n\n제작 흐름\n→ 콘셉트 이미지 (GPT)\n→ 버려진 항구 스테이지와 총 3D 모델 만들기 (Blender + Tripo)\n→ …"},
{"id":"2114250758338334885","url":"https://x.com/designboom/status/2114250758338334885","author":{"name":"designboom","handle":"designboom","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2023759351182221313/ii3bkk5j_200x200.jpg","square":false,"badge":"blue"},"lang":"en","createdAt":"2026-10-25T07:00:36.000Z","rich":["jean prouvé’s 1944 demountable house takes on a new life as a japanese tea pavilion in paris. presented by galerie patrick seguin during design ",["miami.paris","https://miami.paris"]," 2026, the 6×6 structure brings modernist prefabrication into dialogue with the rituals of japanese tea culture."],"media":[{"type":"photo","src":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVdT2mlaoAAVfQC.jpg","w":818,"h":546},{"type":"photo","src":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVdT2wYaAAAranF.jpg","w":818,"h":546},{"type":"photo","src":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVdT24qaQAAdkNS.jpg","w":1800,"h":1200},{"type":"photo","src":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVdT3EgaMAAGlyt.jpg","w":818,"h":613}],"replies":6,"likes":67,"more":true,"topics":["arch"],"addedOn":"2026-10-26","following":false,"ko":"장 프루베가 1944년에 만든 조립식 주택이 파리에서 일본식 다실로 새 삶을 얻었어요. 디자인 마이애미 파리 2026에서 갤러리 파트릭 세갱이 선보인 6×6m 구조물로, 모더니즘의 조립식 건축과 일본 다도 문화의 의식이 만나요."},
