{"id":"2114240768005333159","url":"https://x.com/TechnocratsRock/status/2114240768005333159","author":{"name":"R++＠ゲッター濃度15倍","handle":"TechnocratsRock","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1596873496050954247/AJNXDR1m_200x200.jpg","square":false,"badge":null},"lang":"ja","createdAt":"2026-10-25T06:20:54.000Z","rich":[["#MechGame","https://x.com/hashtag/MechGame"]," ",["#Godot","https://x.com/hashtag/Godot"]," ",["#gamedev","https://x.com/hashtag/gamedev"],"\nリアル系ロボットゲーム「IRONGAIT(仮)」を公開しました！\n対メック戦闘──あります\n対戦車戦闘───あります\n対無人機戦闘──あります\n部位損傷────あります\nデータリンク──あります\nダウンロードは下記のリンクから！\n",["rplus08.itch.io/iron-gait","https://rplus08.itch.io/iron-gait"]],"media":[{"type":"video","src":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2114239738899267584/img/UKmhZo_LtOseSduh.jpg","w":1920,"h":1080,"mp4":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2114239738899267584/vid/avc1/1280x720/Fg4Q2n1GPSEU7491.mp4?tag=14"}],"replies":10,"likes":615,"topics":["gamedev","graphics"],"addedOn":"2026-10-26","following":false,"ko":"#MechGame #Godot #gamedev\n실사풍 로봇 게임 「IRONGAIT(가제)」를 공개했어요!\n메크 대 메크 전투 ── 있어요\n대전차 전투 ── 있어요\n대드론 전투 ── 있어요\n부위 파손 ── 있어요\n데이터 링크 ── 있어요\n아래 링크에서 내려받을 수 있어요!"},
{"id":"2114238128903045532","url":"https://x.com/metrox_eth/status/2114238128903045532","author":{"name":"metr0x","handle":"metrox_eth","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1976156820336177152/AQST9cHr_200x200.jpg","square":false,"badge":"blue"},"lang":"en","createdAt":"2026-10-25T06:10:25.000Z","rich":["First roadside drive for MOSS, the 3D printed open source litter picking robot. \n\nTarmac, slopes, dry grass, fresh grass, the tracks go through all of it like a small bulldozer, nothing jams. Driven from the pad, straight from the battery switch, no laptop in the loop.\n\nNumbers"],"media":[{"type":"video","src":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2114237459743850497/img/5CzT_HrQDMQHq58R.jpg","w":808,"h":1080,"mp4":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2114237459743850497/vid/avc1/720x962/vC7_R3gxdrGALAOC.mp4"}],"replies":18,"likes":220,"more":true,"topics":["tech"],"addedOn":"2026-10-26","following":false,"ko":"3D 프린팅으로 만든 오픈소스 쓰레기 줍기 로봇 MOSS의 첫 도로변 주행이에요.\n\n아스팔트, 경사로, 마른 풀, 새 풀까지 작은 불도저처럼 궤도로 다 지나가고, 걸리는 곳이 없어요. 패드로 조종하고 배터리 스위치만 켜면 바로 움직여요. 노트북은 필요 없어요.\n\n숫자 …"},
