{"id":"2113944569117044835","url":"https://x.com/kimmonismus/status/2113944569117044835","author":{"name":"Chubby♨️","handle":"kimmonismus","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1728327996375719936/RW7VBJfD_200x200.jpg","square":false,"badge":"blue"},"lang":"en","createdAt":"2026-10-24T10:43:55.000Z","rich":["Seriously mindblowing: This voice model runs locally on an M4 Max Mac or better. Feels like magic."],"media":[{"type":"video","src":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2113944379010273280/img/yX61VHSxqkX8gIBK.jpg","w":1920,"h":1080,"mp4":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2113944379010273280/vid/avc1/1280x720/iwHa8AmP44wvXWVH.mp4"}],"replies":175,"likes":2745,"quote":{"id":"2113697902916751661","url":"https://x.com/jack/status/2113697902916751661","author":{"name":"jack","handle":"jack","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1661201415899951105/azNjKOSH_200x200.jpg","square":false,"badge":"blue"},"createdAt":"2026-10-23T18:23:45.000Z","rich":["We believe voice is the most natural way to interact with intelligence, so we created Dessa, the most authentic full-duplex speech model ever built. Talking with it feels like talking with a person…full of emotion, nuance, pauses, and a natural cadence. \n\n",["block.xyz/dessa","https://block.xyz/dessa"]],"media":[]},"topics":["ai","tech"],"addedOn":"2026-10-25","following":true,"ko":"정말 놀라워요. 이 음성 모델은 M4 Max 맥 이상에서 로컬로 돌아가요. 마법 같아요."},
{"id":"2113943184015610129","url":"https://x.com/parametricarch/status/2113943184015610129","author":{"name":"ParametricArchitecture","handle":"parametricarch","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1097430083638345728/S5nwLNO-_200x200.jpg","square":false,"badge":"blue"},"lang":"en","createdAt":"2026-10-24T10:38:24.000Z","rich":["🌀Niemeyer’s iconic self-supporting staircase.\n\nInside Itamaraty Palace, Oscar Niemeyer transformed a simple act of circulation into one of modern architecture’s most celebrated sculptural moments."],"media":[{"type":"photo","src":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVY7-j4WQAEIGrX.jpg","w":1080,"h":1440},{"type":"photo","src":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVY7-jzWEAAi4yk.jpg","w":1080,"h":1440},{"type":"photo","src":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVY7-j1XoAA972I.jpg","w":1080,"h":1440},{"type":"photo","src":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVY7-j5XYAAbhru.jpg","w":1080,"h":1440}],"replies":8,"likes":188,"topics":["arch"],"addedOn":"2026-10-25","following":false,"ko":"🌀 니에메예르의 상징적인 자립식 계단.\n\n이타마라치 궁전 안에서 오스카르 니에메예르는 그저 오르내리는 동선을 현대 건축에서 가장 사랑받는 조각적인 순간 중 하나로 바꿔 놓았어요."},
