{"id":"2113707875290042665","url":"https://x.com/jon_barron/status/2113707875290042665","author":{"name":"Jon Barron","handle":"jon_barron","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2027105545086537728/yiV10DcI_200x200.jpg","square":false,"badge":"blue"},"lang":"en","createdAt":"2026-10-23T19:03:22.000Z","rich":["Hi all, I have a new result I'm excited to share. It turns out that *all existing implementations* of softmax and cross-entropy (that's JAX, PyTorch, textbooks, etc) have a subtle bug --- two bugs, actually. A simple rewrite fixes both, and eliminates \"slingshots\" when grokking:"],"media":[{"type":"video","src":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2113698124351074304/img/LFJgXhcT_P7PthYR.jpg","w":512,"h":512,"mp4":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2113698124351074304/vid/avc1/512x512/MvQolaTrNJczfLpu.mp4"}],"replies":122,"likes":5758,"topics":["ai","science"],"addedOn":"2026-10-25","following":true,"ko":"새로운 결과를 공유하게 되어 기뻐요. 알고 보니 소프트맥스와 크로스 엔트로피의 *기존 구현 전부*(JAX, PyTorch, 교과서 등)에 미묘한 버그가 있어요. 사실은 두 개예요. 간단히 고쳐 쓰면 둘 다 해결되고, 그로킹(grokking) 때 생기는 '슬링샷' 현상도 사라져요:"},
